{"time": "2026-09-09T14:05:27.694680", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "question": "I0.1", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** %I0.1\n\n📍 **Nima bu:** \nBu — **Asosiy boshqaruv ruxsati signalidir (`WorkEnable`)**. U Xavfsizlik PLC'sining (Safety PLC) yordamchi kontaktidan keladi. Uskunada har qanday avtomatik va asosiy ishchi harakatlar bajarilishi uchun ushbu signal doim \"1\" (aktiv) holatida bo'lishi shart.\n\n⚠️ **Ehtimoliy muammolar (xatoliklar):**\n* Favqulodda to'xtatish (E-Stop / Avariyniy) tugmalaridan biri bosilib qolgan.\n* Safety PLC (Xavfsizlik PLC) xatolikka tushgan yoki avariya rejimida o'chib qolgan.\n* Xavfsizlik zanjirining kabeli uzilgan yoki kontaktlar yaxshi tegmayapti.\n* Safety PLC chiqish релеsida yoki 24V quvvat manbaida muammo bor.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Avariyniy tugmalarni tekshiring:** Uskunadagi barcha qizil favqulodda to'xtatish (E-Stop) tugmalarini tekshiring va burab joyiga chiqaring.\n2. **Safety PLC'ni ko'zdan kechiring:** Xavfsizlik PLC modulida qizil xatolik indikatori (SF/BF) yonmayotganiga ishonch hosil qiling.\n3. **Xavfsizlikni tiklang (Reset):** Boshqaruv pultidagi yoki ekrandagi **Safe PLC Reset** (`%I0.7`) / **Fault Reset** (`%I0.4`) tugmasini bosing.\n4. **Elektr zanjirini tekshiring:** PLC kirish modulining `%I0.1` klemmasiga 24V DC kuchlanish kelayotganini multimetr bilan o'lchang."}
{"time": "2026-09-09T14:06:23.140737", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "question": "I77.7", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I77.7` (Input)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:** \nBu — **1-sonli issiqlik ekrani kronshteynini (Bolt 1) uzatish (feeding) mexanizmida detal borligini aniqlovchi datchik (sensor) signali** (`Bolt1SerPartDetect`). \n\nUshbu datchik avtomatik uzatish tizimida 1-kronshteyn detali tayyor va to'g'ri joylashtirilganini PLC'ga bildiradi.\n\n---\n\n⚠️ **Yuzaga kelishi mumkin bo'lgan muammolar:**\n1. **Detal yo'q:** Uzatish patnisida/bunkerida detal tugab qolgan yoki u qiyshiq tushgan.\n2. **Sensor ifloslanishi:** Optik yoki induktsion sensor yuzasi chang, moy yoki payvandlash qoldiqlari bilan qoplangan.\n3. **Kabel/Kontakt xatosi:** Sensor kabeli uzilgan, burallgan yoki ulanish klemmasida kontakt yo'qolgan.\n4. **Sensor masofasi o'zgargan:** Mexanik siljish sababli sensor detalni ko'rmayapti (masofa uzoqlashgan).\n\n---\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Detalni tekshiring:** 1-sonli kronshteynni uzatish zonasida detal borligini va u o'z joyida to'g'ri o'tirganini tekshiring.\n2. **Sensorni tozalang:** %I77.7 datchigi yuzasini toza mato bilan arting.\n3. **Indikatorni kuzating:** Detal sensor qarshisiga kelganda datchikdagi diod (chiroq) yonayotganini tekshiring.\n4. **Holatni sozlang:** Agar detal bor bo'lsa-yu, lekin indikator yonmasa, sensorni detalga biroz yaqinroq surib sozlang yoki kabel ulanishini tekshiring."}
{"time": "2026-09-09T14:10:17.764722", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "question": "I55.5", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I55.5`\n\n📍 **Nima bu:**\nBu — **4-sonli vstavka/moslama qo'yish (Inlay 4) silindrining o'rta holati (Middle Position)** sensori signali (`Inlay4FeedMP`). Ushbu signal silindr harakat davomida o'rta nuqtaga yetib kelganini PLC ga bildiradi.\n\n**Ehtimoliy muammolar (xatoliklar):**\n- **Mexanik to'siq:** Silindr pnevmatikasi (havo bosimi) pastligi yoki mexanik tiqilib qolish sababli o'rta holatga yetib borolmagan.\n- **Sensor nosozligi:** Silindrdagi magnetik sensor (reed switch) joyidan surilib ketgan, ifloslangan yoki buzilgan.\n- **Elektr kabeli:** Sensor kabeli uzilgan, qisilgan yoki PLC kirish modulidagi kontakt bo'shashgan.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Mexanik va havo bosimini tekshiring:** 4-inlay mexanizmi va silindri erkin harakatlanayotganini, havo liniyasida bosim yetarli ekanligini (kamida 4–6 bar) ko'rib chiqing.\n2. **Sensor indikatorini tekshiring:** Silindr o'rta holatga kelganida sensor ustidagi LED chiroqcha yonayotganini ko'ring.\n   - *Agar chiroq yonmasa:* Sensorni silindr korpusi bo'ylab biroz surib sozlab ko'ring yoki sensorni almashtiring.\n3. **Kabelni tekshiring:** Sensor kabelida fizik shikastlanish yo'qligiga va terminalga ulanish mahkamligiga ishonch hosil qiling."}
{"time": "2026-09-09T14:17:42.378465", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "question": "M0.1", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** %M0.1\n\n📍 **Nima bu:**\nBu — PLC tizimining doimiy \"O'chirilgan\" holatdagi mantiqiy ichki biti (**AlwaysOff**). U jismoniy sensor yoki tugma emas, balki PLC dasturi ichida turli mantiqiy shartlarni doimiy ravishda manfiy (`FALSE` / 0) holatda ushlab turish yoki bloklash uchun ishlatiladigan tizim belgisidir.\n\n⚠️ **Kuzatilishi mumkin bo'lgan holatlar:**\n* Bu bit jismoniy qurilmaga (kabel, sensor, rele) bog'liq emas.\n* Agar dasturda ushbu bit `TRUE` (1) bo'lib qolsa yoki monitoring paytida o'zgarsa, CPU tizim xotirasi sozlamalari (System memory byte) buzilgan bo'lishi mumkin.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **PLC holatini tekshiring:** TIA Portal dasturida monitoring (online) rejimiga o'ting va `%M0.1` biti rostdan ham `FALSE` (0) holatida turganini tasdiqlang.\n2. **CPU sozlamalarini ko'rib chiqing:** `CPU Properties` -> `System and clock memory` bo'limiga kiring va \"System memory byte\" to'g'ri sozlangani va ajratilganini tekshiring.\n3. **Dastur mantiqini tekshiring:** Dastur ichida bu bit boshqa mantiqiy bloklar tomonidan tasodifan ustidan yozib yuborilmayotganiga (overwrite) ishonch hosil qiling."}
{"time": "2026-09-09T14:38:51.830812", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "question": "M110.3", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** %M110.3\n\n📍 **Nima bu:**\nBu — **muayyan (qismatli) isitish elementlarini yoqish** uchun ishlatiladigan PLC ichki xotira biti (`PartHeaton`). Uskunada barcha isitgichlarni emas, faqat kerakli ishchi hududlardagi (masalan, payvandlash pichoqlari yoki qizdirish bloklari) isitish tizimini ishga tushirish buyrug'ini beradi.\n\n⚠️ **Yuzaga kelishi mumkin bo'lgan muammolar:**\n* HMI (operator ekrani) orqali isitishni yoqish buyrug'i berilganda mantiqiy shartlar bajarilmagani sababli bit faollashmasligi.\n* Isitish bloklarining avtomat o'chirgichlari (Circuit Breakers) yoki kontaktorlari o'chib qolganligi.\n* Harorat datchiklari (termoparalar) uzilgani yoki noto'g'ri ko'rsatkich berayotgani tufayli tizim isitishni taqiqlab qo'yilishi.\n* Xavfsizlik zanjiri (E-Stop tugmalari, xavfsizlik eshiklari yoki light curtain) ochiq qolganligi.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **HMI panelni tekshiring:** Operator ekranidagi isitish menyusida mos isitish zonasi yoqilganini va harorat chegaralari to'g'ri o'rnatilganini ko'ring.\n2. **Xavfsizlik tizimini tekshiring:** Tizimdagi avariya tugmalari (E-stop) bosilmaganiga va xavfsizlik to'siqlari xatosi yo'qligiga ishonch hosil qiling.\n3. **Elektr shkafni ko'zdan kechiring:** Isitish liniyalariga mas'ul bo'lgan avtomatlar (QF) va kontaktor/relelar tutab ketmaganini, o'chib qolmaganini tekshiring.\n4. **Harorat modullari datchiklarini tekshiring:** Harorat modullarining (Temperature Modules) simlari uzilmaganini va TIA Portal/HMI'da harorat xatoligi (TempAbnormalAlarm) yo'qligini aniqlang."}
{"time": "2026-09-09T14:42:17.910361", "user_id": 5026106651, "username": "qurbonovjumanazar", "question": "I55.5", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I55.5` (Tag nomi: `Inlay4FeedMP`)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:**\nBu — **4-sonli vtulka/vkladish presslash (Inlay 4) mexanizmining uzatish (feed) silindri o'rta holatda (Middle Position)** ekanligini bildiruvchi datchik (sensor) signalidir. Silindr boshlang'ich va oxirgi nuqta orasidagi o'rta pozitsiyaga yetib kelganda ushbu signal PLCga uzatiladi.\n\n⚠️ **Yuzaga kelishi mumkin bo'lgan muammolar:**\n* Silindr mexanik ravishda qisilib qolgan yoki yo'lida to'siq borligi sababli o'rta holatga yetib kela olmayapti.\n* Pnevmotizimda havo bosimi yetarli emas yoki pnevmovana (klapan) ishlamayapti.\n* Silindr ustidagi magnetik sensor (germkon) joyidan siljib ketgan yoki noto'g'ri sozlangan.\n* Sensor kabeli uzilgan, kontakt zanglagan/bo'shashgan yoki sensorning o'zi ishdan chiqqan.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Mexanik holatni ko'zdan kechiring:** 4-sonli vtulka presslash (Inlay 4) pnevmosilindri jismonan o'rta holatda turganini va harakatlanishiga hech narsa xalaqit bermayotganini tekshiring.\n2. **Sensor indikatorini tekshiring:** Silindr o'rta holatga kelganda sensor ustidagi LED chiroqcha yonayotganini ko'ring. Agar yonmasa, sensorni silindr bo'ylab biroz surib sozlashingiz yoki almashtirishingiz kerak bo'ladi.\n3. **PLC modulini tekshiring:** PLC kirish modulida (Input module) `%I55.5` manziliga mos keluvchi indikator yonyaptimi-yo'qmi, tekshiring.\n4. **Havo bosimini tekshiring:** Tizimdagi umumiy va ushbu silindrga kelayotgan pnevmatik havo bosimi normada (kamida 4 bar) ekanligiga ishonch hosil qiling.\n5. **Elektr zanjirini tekshiring:** Sensor kabelida uzilish yo'qligini va u BN (I/O) moduliga to'g'ri ulanganini muvofiqlashtiring."}
{"time": "2026-09-09T15:40:01.565962", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "question": "I10.5", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I10.5` (TIA Portal tag: `PumpBoreLinearSliWP`)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:** \nBu — **Sensor teshigini teshish mexanizmi surilmasining (linear slide) ishchi holatga (oldingi pozitsiyaga) yetib kelganini bildiruvchi datchik signali**. \n\n*Soddaroq aytganda:* Teshish mexanizmi pnevmocilindr orqali oldinga surilganda, ushbu datchik ishlaydi va PLC'ga \"mexanizm teshish uchun kerakli joyga yetib keldi\" degan xabarni beradi.\n\n---\n\n⚠️ **Ushbu signalda kelib chiqishi mumkin bo'lgan muammolar:**\n1. **Mexanik to'siq:** Mexanizm yo'lida biror narsa qisilib qolgan va silindr oxirigacha bormayapti.\n2. **Havo bosimi pastligi:** Pnevmatika tizimida havo bosimi yetarli emas (kamida 4 bar bo'lishi kerak).\n3. **Datchik sozlamasi buzilgan:** Silindr ustidagi gerkon (reed switch) yoki datchik surilib ketgan.\n4. **Kabel uzilishi / Datchik nosozligi:** Sensor buzilgan yoki uning kabeli/ulagichi (connector) zararlangan.\n\n---\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak (Yangi xodim uchun amaliy qadamlar):**\n\n1. **Mexanizmni ko'zdan kechiring:** \n   - Teshish mexanizmi oldinga to'liq surilganmi? Yo'lida mexanik to'siq, kir yoki qisilib qolgan detal yo'qligini tekshiring.\n2. **Havo bosimini tekshiring:** \n   - Manometrdan havo bosimi kamida **4 bar** ekanligiga ishonch hosil qiling (`%I0.5` bosim relesi).\n3. **Datchik indikatorini (LED) tekshiring:**\n   - Mexanizm oldinga borganda datchik ustidagi kichik indikator chiroqcha yonyaptimi?\n   - **Chiroq yonmasa:** Datchikni silindr bo'ylab ozgina surib, mos pozitsiyaga sozlang.\n   - **Chiroq yonsa, lekin PLC qabul qilmasa:** Datchikdan PLC moduligacha bo'lgan kabel va klemmalarni tekshiring.\n4. **Qo'l rejimida (Manual) tekshirish:**\n   - Boshqaruv panelidan (HMI) teshish mexanizmini qo'lda (Manual) oldinga va orqaga surib ko'ring, harakat ravonligini va datchik o'z vaqtida signal berayotganini kuzating."}
{"time": "2026-09-09T16:30:54.179007", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "question": "I0.5", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I0.5` (PressureSwitch)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:**\nBu — tizimning **asosiy havo bosimi datchigi (Pressure Switch)** signali. U uskunaga kelayotgan pnevmatik havo bosimi yetarli darajada (kamida **4 bar**) bor yoki yo'qligini nazorat qiladi. Havo bosimi me'yordan tushib ketsa, uskuna xavfsizlik yuzasidan ishdan to'xtaydi.\n\n⚠️ **Ushbu signal bo'yicha yuzaga kelishi mumkin bo'lgan muammolar:**\n1. Tizimda havo bosimi yetarsiz (4 bar'dan past).\n2. Havo shlanglarida teshib chiqish (sizib chiqish) yoki shlang bukilib/qisilib qolgan.\n3. Asosiy pnevmo-blokdagi (FRL unit) bosim sozlagichi noto'g me'yorda (o'zgarib ketgan).\n4. Bosim datchigining (relesining) o'zi nosoz yoki kontaktlari zanglagan.\n5. Datchik elektr kabeli uzilgan, ulagichi (konnektor) bo'shagan.\n6. PLC ning kirish moduli (Input module) terminalida sim bo'shab qolgan.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak (Amaliy qadamlar):**\n\n1. **Manometrni tekshiring:** Uskunaga kirishdagi pnevmo-blokdagi manometrga qarang. Bosim kamida **4 bar** ekanligiga ishonch hosil qiling.\n2. **Bosimni sozlang:** Agar bosim past bo'lsa, pnevmo-sozlagich (sozlash qopqog'i) orqali bosimni 4 bar ga ko'taring.\n3. **Havo liniyasini ko'zdan kechiring:** Magistral havo shlanglarini, tezkor ulagichlarni (фитинг) va klapanlarni havo chiqib ketmayotganiga yoki bukilib qolmaganiga tekshiring.\n4. **Datchik indikatorini tekshiring:** Bosim datchigining korpusidagi svetodiod (LED) indikatori yonib turganini ko'ring.\n5. **Elektr simlarni tekshiring:** Datchik kabeli va PLC terminalidagi `%I0.5` klemmasida sim yaxshi qisilganini va uzilish yo'qligini tekshiring.\n6. **Multimetr bilan o'lchang:** Datchik kontaktlarida va PLC kirishida 24V DC kuchlanish kelayotganini tekshiring. Signal kelmayotgan bo'lsa va bosim 4 bar bo'lsa — datchikni almashtiring."}
{"time": "2026-09-09T16:59:13.902491", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "question": "I11.1", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** %I11.1\n\n📍 **Nima bu:** \nBu — **Sensor teshigini teshish (punching) mexanizmi qisqichining (katsva) ishchi holatga kelganlik (siqilganlik) signali** (`PumpBoreRClampWP`). \n\nUskuna sensor teshigini teshish jarayonini boshlashdan oldin pnevmatik qisqich orqali detalni ushlab oladi. Ushbu signal qisqich silindri oxirgi ishchi nuqtasiga yetib borganini va detal ishonchli ushlangani haqida PLC'ga ma'lumot beradi.\n\n**Yuzaga kelishi mumkin bo'lgan muammolar:**\n* **Mexanik to'siq:** Qisqich orasiga chiqindi/zarracha tiqilib qolgani sababli oxirigacha yopilmasligi.\n* **Sensor nosozligi:** Silindr ustidagi magnit datchik (germakon) siljib ketgan, zanjiri uzilgan yoki ishdan chiqqan.\n* **Pnevmatika muammosi:** Havo bosimi pastligi yoki solenoid klapan (valv) yaxshi ishlamayotgani sababli silindr yetarlicha kuch bilan harakatlanmayotgani.\n* **Kabel nosozligi:** Datchik kabeli uzilgan yoki terminal bloki (klemma) bo'shashgan.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Mexanik holatni ko'zdan kechiring:** Qisqich jismonan oxirigacha yopilganini va uni to'sib turgan begona narsalar yo'qligini tekshiring.\n2. **Datchik chirog'ini (LED) tekshiring:** Qisqich yopilgan holatda silindr ustidagi datchik indikatori (chirog'i) yonyaptimi? Agar yonmasa, datchikni silindr bo'ylab biroz surib sozlab ko'ring.\n3. **PLC moduldagi signalni tekshiring:** Datchik yonganda PLC kirish modulida (Input Module) **I11.1** LED diodi yonayotganini ko'ring. Datchik yonsa-yu, PLC'da chiroq yonmasa — kabellarni va ulanish nuqtalarini (klemmani) tekshiring.\n4. **Havo bosimini tekshiring:** Tizimdagi havo bosimi yetarli darajada (kamida 4 bar) ekanligiga va pnevmo-klapan signalga javob berayotganiga ishonch hosil qiling."}
{"time": "2026-09-09T18:44:27.722639", "line": "sa3", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "question": "I30.3", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I30.3` (PLC tag ro'yxatida **topilmadi**)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:**\nSiz kiritgan `%I30.3` manzili ushbu \"SA3 welding\" uskunasi PLC taglar jadvalida **mavjud emas**. \n\nImlo xatosi bo'lishi mumkinligini hisobga olsak, quyidagi o'xshash manzillardan biri nazarda tutilgan bo'lishi mumkin:\n\n1. **%I3.3** — **ST1 stansiyasi:** `R1-1LoadPartDetection1` (R1-1 joyidagi detektor/detal borligini aniqlovchi sensor signali).\n2. **%I300.3** — **R3 roboti (1-blok):** `R3-1_Signal 4` (R3-1 hot plate / isitish plastinasining oxirgi holatga/joyiga yetib kelganlik signali).\n3. **%I303.3** — **R3 roboti:** R3-1零点 (Zero-point) moduli signali.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. Manzilni to'g'ri kiritganingizni qayta tekshiring (masalan, `%I3.3` yoki `%I300.3` emasmi?).\n2. Agar boshqa manzil bo me'yoriy ishlamayotgan bo'lsa, qaysi stansiyada (ST1, ST2, ST3) va qaysi robotda (R1–R6) muammo bo'layotganini hamda HMI ekranida qanday xatolik ko'rinayotganini yozib yuboring."}
{"time": "2026-09-09T18:46:36.528153", "line": "sa3", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "question": "I0.2", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I0.2` (Tag: `ST1HeatEnable`)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:**\nBu — **1-stansiya (ST1) isitish tizimiga ruxsat berish signali** (ST1 加热使能).\nElektr shkafidagi rele kontakti orqali PLC-ga keladi. Bu signal \"1\" (faol) bo'lsagina, ST1 stansiyasidagi isitish elementlari (isitgichlar, hot plate/mould) ishlashiga ruxsat beriladi.\n\n⚠️ **Yuzaga kelishi mumkin bo me'yoriy/fizik xatoliklar:**\n- Isitish relesi (relay) kontaktlari yopishib qolgani yoki kuydirib uzilgani.\n- Relega keluvchi 24V boshqaruv simining bo'shashib qolishi yoki uzilishi.\n- Xavfsizlik zanjirida (termostat, datchik, datchik kabeli) uzilish sodir bo'lgani uchun rele tortmayotgani.\n- PLC raqamli kirish (Digital Input) modulining mos kanali nosozligi.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **PLC panelini tekshirish:** ST1 elektr shkafidagi PLC modulida `%I0.2` kirish indikatori (LED) yonyaptimi-yo'qligini ko'ring.\n2. **Releni tekshiring:** ST1 elektr shkafidagi tegishli isitish relesi (Heat Relay) tortganini va uning kontaktlari orqali signal o'tayotganini multimetr yordamida (24V DC) o'lchang.\n3. **Kabel va ulanishlarni ko'zdan kechiring:** Reledan PLC moduliga boruvchi simlar va klemma bloklari mahkam qisilganini tekshiring.\n4. **Isitish va xavfsizlik shartlarini ko'ring:** Tizimda harorat datchiklari (RTD) va boshqa xavfsizlik interloklari o'chib qolmaganiga ishonch hosil qiling."}
{"time": "2026-09-09T18:52:39.845389", "line": "sa3", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "question": "I10.1", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** %I10.1\n\n📍 **Nima bu:** ST1 stansiyasidagi konveyer liniyasining to'xtash (stop) sensori signali (**Conveyor-StopDetect** / 输送线停止检测). Ushbu datchik konveyerda detal to'xtash zonasiga kelganini yoki to'xtash pozitsiyasini aniqlash uchun xizmat qiladi.\n\n⚠️ **Yuzaga kelishi mumkin bo'lgan muammolar:**\n- Sensor yuzasi ifloslanishi (chang, moy yoki payvandlash qoldiqlari to'sishi);\n- Konveyerda detal tiqilib qolishi yoki noto'g me'yordan tashqari joylashishi;\n- Sensor kabelining uzilishi yoki konnektor kontaktining bo'shashishi;\n- Sensor mexanik ravishda joyidan surilib ketishi yoki datchikning o'zi ishdan chiqishi.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Sensorni tozalang:** Datchik (fotodatchik/sensor) optik yuzasini mato bilan yaxshilab arting.\n2. **Mexanik to'siqlarni tekshiring:** Konveyer liniyasida detallar tiqilib qolmaganini va sensor joyidan surilmaganini ko'zdan kechiring.\n3. **Signalni tekshiring:** Detal sensor oldiga kelganda datchik korpusidagi LED indikator chirog me'yorida yonib-o'chayotganini kuzating.\n4. **Kabelni tekshiring:** Sensor kabelida uzilish yo'qligini va PLC I/O moduliga boruvchi ulanishlar mahkamligini tekshiring."}
{"time": "2026-09-09T18:59:47.128020", "line": "gem", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "question": "I10.2", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I10.2` (Tag nomi: `PumpBoreFloatSliHP`)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:**\nBu signal — datchik teshigini teshish (punching) mexanizmining **suzuvchi markazlash moslamasi (baza/slayd) boshlang'ich (bosh) holatda** ekanligini bildiruvchi sensor (datchik) signalidir.\n\n⚠️ **Yuzaga kelishi mumkin bo'lgan muammolar:**\n* Mexanizm mexanik ushlanib qolgan va ortga (boshlang'ich holatga) to'liq qaytmagan.\n* Datchik (sensor) joyidan surilib ketgan, yuzasiga metal qirindilari/kir to'plangan yoki o'zi buzilgan.\n* Pnevmatik havo bosimi yetarli emas yoki pnevmotsilindr tiqilib qolgan.\n* Datchik kabelida uzilish bor yoki PLC moduliga ulanishda kontakt yo'qolgan.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Mexanizmni ko'zdan kechiring:** Teshish bloki (Pump Bore) qismidagi markazlash moslamasi jismonan orqaga to'liq qaytganini va harakatga hech narsa xalaq bermayotganini tekshiring.\n2. **Datchikni tekshiring:** Moslama orqada turganda datchikdagi indikator (chiroq) yonayotganini ko'ring. Agar yonmasa, datchikni tozalang va masofasini sozlrang.\n3. **Havo bosimini tekshiring:** Pnevmo-tizimda havo bosimi (kamida 4 bar) borligini tekshiring.\n4. **PLC indikatorini tekshiring:** PLC shkafida `I10.2` kirish chirog'i yonayotganini va kabel ulanishlarini ko'rib chiqing."}
{"time": "2026-09-10T11:15:16.809215", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "deflashing", "question": "I0.2", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** %I0.2 (`I0.2_CoolingMachineVersionID1`)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:** \nSuv bilan sovutish integratsiyasi versiyasining **ID1 kodi signali** (Water Cooling Machine Version ID1). Bu raqamli kirish (DI) signali bo'lib, PLC ga qaysi sovutish tizimi/modeli ulanib turganini aniqlash (kodni o'qish) uchun xizmat qiladi.\n\n⚠️ **Odatda yuzaga keladigan muammolar:**\n* Kabel uzilishi yoki terminalda kontakt bo'shashishi (signal PLC-ga yetib bormaydi).\n* Versiya tanlash selektori (kod pinhon/pereklyuchatel) noto'g'ri o'rnatilgani yoki kontaktdagi muammo.\n* 24V DC sensor quvvati yo'qligi.\n* Tizimda suvli sovutish aggregati versiyasi noto'g'ri tanlangani bo'yicha mantiqiy xatolik paydo bo'lishi.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **PLC LED indikatorini tekshiring:** Elektr shkafdagi kirish modulida `%I0.2` chirog'i (LED) yonayotganini ko'ring.\n2. **Kabel va klemenslarni tekshiring:** Suv sovutish bloki va PLC shkafi o'rtasidagi kabel shikastlanmaganini, klemenslar yaxshi qisilganini tekshiring.\n3. **Kuchlanishni o me'yorlang:** Multimetr yordamida `%I0.2` klemensida +24V DC Signal bor-yo'qligini o'lchang.\n4. **ID kodi va HMI sozlamasini tekshiring:** Suv sovutish tizimidagi versiya kaliti (ID switch) to'g'ri holatda ekanini va bu HMI dagi retsept/modelga mos kelishini tasdiqlang."}
{"time": "2026-09-10T11:16:24.429761", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "watercool", "question": "I10.3", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I10.3`\n\n📍 **Nima bu:** \nChap stansiya 2-qolip qulflash mexanizmining dastlabki (boshlang'ich) holat datchigi signali (`L_CoolModeLock2HP` — 左模具锁位2原位). \nBu signal chap tomondagi 2-qolip qulfi orqaga to'liq qaytganini (ochiq/boshlang'ich holatda ekanligini) PLC ga bildiradi.\n\n**Yuzaga kelishi mumkin bo'lgan muammolar:**\n* Qulflash tsilindri (pnevmatik/gidravlik) mexanik tirqish yoki to'siq sababli oxirigacha orqaga qaytmagan.\n* Induktiv datchik (sensor) kirlangan (suv, yog' yoki chang bilan qoplangan).\n* Datchik kabeli uzilgan yoki kontakti bo'shashgan.\n* Pnevmatik klapan (solenoid) ishlamayapti yoki havo bosimi yetarsiz.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Mexanik qismni ko'zdan kechiring:** Chap stansiyadagi 2-qolipsimon qulf (lock 2) jismonan oxirigacha orqaga tortilganini tekshiring.\n2. **Sensorni tozalang va indikatorni tekshiring:** Datchik yuzasini mato bilan tozalang. Tsilindr orqaga qaytganda datchikdagi LED chiroq yonayotganini ko'ring.\n3. **Havo/Yog' bosimini tekshiring:** Qulfni orqaga tortuvchi havo bosimi yetarlimi va pnevmo-klapan ishlayaptimi — shuni tekshiring.\n4. **Elektr ulanishini tekshiring:** Datchikdan PLC kirish moduliga (`%I10.3`) kelayotgan kabelda uzilish yoki kontakt sustligi yo'qligiga ishonch hosil qiling."}
{"time": "2026-09-10T11:58:12.658729", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "deflashing", "question": "I19.0", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I19.0`\n\n📍 **Nima bu:** R3 **修边机器人2** (robot 2) **飞边夹取气缸** — flasher/yalangchoq olish silindrining **夹紧位 (HP)** magnetik sensori. Ya'ni silindr \"qisqargan/clamp\" holatida raqib \"1\" signal beradi.\n\n⚠️ **Kuzatuvda ko'p uchraydigan muammolar:**\n- Silindr havo bosimi past / kazanka утечка → cilinder tejamkor yo'qoladi\n- Magnit halqa silindrda cho'kib ketgan/yomonlik → sensor reaksiy bermaydi\n- Kabel uzilgan / konektor bo'satgan\n- Sensor ifloslangan yoki moslashtirilmagan\n- Mekanik to'siq (qog'oz/lom silindrga yopishgan)\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak (tekshirish tartibi):**\n1. Robot rejimida silindrga harakat bering — shovqin/hozirlikni tinglang\n2. Hava ta'minoti (Фilter/regulator) bosimi 5-6 bar ekanini tekshiring\n3. Sensor ulagichini oyib, tozalang, o'rnatishni qayta tiklang\n4. TCLA/forced test — operatordan silindrni \"clamp\" ga majburlab bosing, %I19.0 \"1\" ga o'tishini ko'ring\n5. Agar signal kelmasa — kabelni ohxatlab tekshiring (I/O kartaga qadar)\n\nAgar signal \"0\" deb qolsa va robot \"R3 flash grab\" ni bajara olmasa — konveyerda qog'oz bloklanadi. Agar \"1\" deb qolib silindr harakat qilmasa — solinuvchanlik/magnit muammo.\n\nQaysi holatda ekaningiz (silindr harakat qilmayaptimi, yoki robot alarm berayaptimi) yozsangiz, aniqroq yordam beraman."}
{"time": "2026-09-10T12:29:04.321436", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "watercoolrobot", "question": "I0.3", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** %I0.3 *(Berilgan PLC taglar ro'yxatida aniq nomi topilmadi)*\n\n📍 **Nima bu:** `%I0.3` — bu PLC ning raqamli kirish (Digital Input) signali hisoblanadi. Odatda bu manzilga biror sensor (foto datchik, indutiv datchik), chegara kaliti (limit switch), knopka yoki xavfsizlik zanjiri signali ulangan bo'ladi. Afsuski, taqdim etilgan jadvalda bu manzilga biriktirilgan aniq tag nomi va tavsifi berilmagan.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Datchik yoki tugmani vizual tekshiring:** %I0.3 kirishiga ulangan sensor indikatori (chirog'i) yonayotganini va uning oldida to'siq yo'qligini tekshiring.\n2. **PLC modulidagi chiroqni tekshiring:** PLC ning `DI 0` modulidagi `3`-indikator chirog me'yorda yonayotganini yoki signal kelayotganini ko'ring.\n3. **Kabel va ulanishlarni ko me'yordan chiqmaganini biling:** Sensorgacha bo'lgan kabelda uzilish yo'qligini va 24V quvvat manbai yetib borayotganini muhandislik testeri (multimetr) bilan tekshiring.\n4. **Qo'shimcha ma'lumot bering:** Agar muammo hal bo'lmasa, bu signal qaysi stansiyaga (masalan, ST1, ST2) tegishli ekanligi yoki ekranda chiqayotgan xatolik kodi/matnini yozib yuboring."}
{"time": "2026-09-10T13:13:03.225411", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "gem", "question": "I0.5", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** %I0.5  \n📍 **Nima bu:** Uish (4 bar) bosish bosqichi bosganda ishga tushadigan bosish kalibi. Bu signal atmosferik bosishni kuzatib, kerakli bosish darajasig'ga egaligini tekshiruvchi dutka.  \n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**  \n1. Boshqaruv panelasida bosish darajasini tekshiring (4 bar ega bo'lishi kerak).  \n2. I0.5 signalini \"Online monitoring\" rejimida kuzatib Boringizki signaldan havola topdim.  \n3. Qurilishning ishlashini to'xtatib, dutkani qo'lda ishga tushiring (boshqaruv tugmachasini bosib).  \n4. Agar signal qolmasa, kabel va utka ulanishini tekshiring, havo bosish iniksizligini sinab ko'rinish (sokinchasi, truba kirishi, kompressor xatosi).  \n**Muhim yo'qotish:** Signal yo'qolsa, o'tkazilishchi mashina ishlamaydi, chunki shifterlar faqat kiforli bosishda ishlaydi.  \n---  \n**Note:** Agar bunday muammo kelsa, unga mos boltir vositani (mushak, kabel) topishda qo'shimcha yordam bera olaman."}
{"time": "2026-09-10T19:42:40.784623", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "watercoolrobot", "question": "I10.1", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I10.1` (Tag nomi: `MainEnable`)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:**\nBu **Asosiy boshqaruvni yoqish / ruxsat berish (Main Enable)** kirish signalidir. U Xavfsizlik PLC (Safety PLC) yoki xavfsizlik relesining yordamchi kontaktidan keladi. Tizim avtomatik yoki xavfsiz rejimda ishlashi uchun bu signal har doim faol (1 / 24V) bo'lishi shart. Agar bu signal o'chgan bo'lsa, uskuna xavfsizlik yuzasidan barcha harakatlarni to'xtatadi.\n\n**Yuzaga kelishi mumkin bo me'yoriy va nosozlik holatlari:**\n* Biron bir datchik yoki eshik ochiqligi sababli xavfsizlik tizimi tushib ketgan (Tripped).\n* Avariya (E-Stop) tugmalaridan biri bosilgan holatda qolgan.\n* Xavfsizlik relesi yoki Safety PLC kontaktorining yordamchi kontakti yomon ulanmoqda yoki kuygan.\n* Xavfsizlik relesidan PLC I10.1 terminaliga keluvchi kabel uzilgan.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Avariya (E-Stop) tugmalarini tekshiring:** Barcha favqulodda to'xtatish tugmalari (HMI, kirish joyi, xavfsizlik eshiklaridagi E-Stop) burab chiqariqligini (yoqilmaganini) tekshiring.\n2. **Xavfsizlik eshiklarini tekshiring:** Barcha xavfsizlik eshiklari yopiq va qulflanganligiga ishonch hosil qiling.\n3. **Xavfsizlikni qayta yoqing (Safe Reset):** Boshqaruv panelidagi **\"Safe Reset\"** (Xavfsizlikni tiklash) tugmasini bosing.\n4. **Shkaf ichini ko'zdan kechiring:** Elektrik shkafdagi Safety PLC yoki xavfsizlik relesi holatini (LED chiroqlarini) tekshiring. Ularda xatolik (RED / Alarm) bormi?\n5. **Kuchlanishni o'lchang:** Multimetr yordamida PLC ning `%I10.1` terminalida +24V DC signal bor-yo'qligini o'lchab ko'ring. Agar xavfsizlik tizimi tiklangan bo'lsa-yu, lekin 24V kelmayotgan bo'lsa, kabel va kontaktlarni tekshiring."}
{"time": "2026-09-10T19:43:36.913414", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "watercoolrobot", "question": "I12.1", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** %I12.1 (`RobotTankDetect2`)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:**\nBu — **Robot tutqichidagi (gripper/fiksator) 2-moy bakini aniqlash datchigi** (oxirgi kalit / limit switch / 行程开关). \nRobot tutqichida moy baki bor-yo'qligini va u to'g'ri joylashganini aniqlab, PLC ga signal beradi.\n\n**Yuzaga kelishi mumkin bo'lgan muammolar:**\n* Bak robot tutqichida noto'g'ri joylashgan yoki tushib ketgan.\n* Datchikning mexanik richagi (roligi) moy, kir yoki qoldiqlar sababli qisilib qolgan.\n* Robot doimiy harakatda bo'lgani uchun kabel zanjirida (kabel-kanal) sim uzilgan yoki ulanish konnektori bo'shab qolgan.\n* Datchik kronshteyni mexanik zarba sababli surilib ketgan va bakka tegmay qolgan.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Vizual tekshiring:** Robot tutqichida bak borligini va datchikning mexanik richagi bakka to'liq tegib turganini ko'ring.\n2. **Datchikni tozalang va sinang:** Datchikni moy va kirdan tozalang. Qo'l bilan bosib ko'rib, erkin harakatlanayotganini va chertish (klik) ovozi chiqayotganini tekshiring.\n3. **Elektr signalini va kabelni tekshiring:** Datchik bosilganda klemens yoki robot ustidagi raz'yomda signal chirog'i yonayotganini ko'ring. Robot harakatlanadigan kabel zanjiri (drag chain) ichidagi simlarni uzilishga tekshiring.\n4. **PLC indikatsiyasini tekshiring:** Datchik bosilganda PLC modulidagi `%I12.1` kirish indikatoy yoqilishi kerak. Agar chiroq yonmasa — datchik yoki kabel nosoz."}
{"time": "2026-09-11T09:57:37.373178", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "deflashing", "question": "I2.1", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I2.1` (`I2.1_MainEnable`)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:** Asosiy boshqaruvni yoqish/ruxsat berish signali (Main Control Enable). Bu signal elektr shkafdagi xavfsizlik relesining (Safety Relay) yordamchi kontaktidan PLC’ga keladi. Uskunaning xavfsizlik tizimi (E-Stop tugmalari, xavfsizlik eshiklari, yorug'lik pardalari) normal holatda va ishlashga tayyor ekanligini bildiradi.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Xavfsizlik tizimini tekshiring:** Barcha avariya to'xtatish (E-Stop) tugmalari chiqarilganligini va xavfsizlik eshiklari/toshiqlari to'liq yopiqligini tekshiring.\n2. **Xavfsizlik relesini (Safety Relay) ko'rib chiqing:** Elektr shkafi (`Cabit_DI`) ichidagi xavfsizlik relesida xatolik chirog'i yonmayotganiga ishonch hosil qiling va tizimning \"Reset\" tugmasini bosing.\n3. **Simlar va kontaktlarni tekshiring:** Xavfsizlik relesi kontaktidan PLC’ning `%I2.1` kirish terminaligacha bo'lgan kabel uzilmaganini va ulanishlar bo'shab qolmaganini multimetr bilan tekshiring.\n4. **PLC indikatorini kuzating:** Xavfsizlik zanjiri tiklanganda PLC’dagi `I2.1` kirish LED chirog'i yonishi kerak. Agar chiroq yonmasa, rele kontakti yomonlashgan yoki 24V quvvat uzilgan bo'lishi mumkin."}
{"time": "2026-09-11T10:01:00.353250", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "gem", "question": "Canister Weld:The fusion Pressure is too high", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** \n- `%IW272` (`CanisterWeldPress` — Kanistr kronshteynini payvandlash bosim datchigi)\n- `%T32` (`CanisterWeldPressTimer` — Bosim xatoligi taymeri)\n- `%M120.1` (`CanisterWeldForceTempAlarm` — Bosim/Harorat xatoligi signalizatsiyasi)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:** \nBu signal payvandlash (fusion) jarayonida tsilindr orqali amalda tushayotgan bosimni o'lchovchi analog sensor signalidir (`%IW272`). Tizim belgilangan vaqt ichida o'lchangan bosim me'yoriy chegaradan (max limit) yuqori ekanligini aniqlaganda ushbu xatolikni beradi.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Pnevmatik regulyatorni tekshiring:** Payvandlash tsilindriga kelayotgan pnevmatik havo bosimini (sistemadagi manometr va proportsional/qo'l regulyatorini) ko'ring. Bosim me'yordan oshib ketgan bo'lsa, uni pasaytiring.\n2. **Bosim datchigini (%IW272) solishtiring:** Tizimdagi haqiqiy pnevmatik manometr qiymati bilan PLC'dagi `%IW272` analog qiymatini solishtiring. Agar farq katta bo'lsa, datchik nosoz yoki kalibrovkasi buzilgan bo'lishi mumkin (datchikni almashtiring yoki rekalibrovka qiling).\n3. **Mexanik tiqilishlarni tekshiring:** Payvandlash tsilindri (`CanisterWeldFusCylAdv` %Q53.2) va uning yo'naltiruvchi mexanizmlari (guide rails) harakat paytida qisilib qolmayotganini ko'ring. Mexanik qarshilik tufayli bosim sun'iy ravishda oshib ketishi mumkin.\n4. **Elektr ulanishi va kabelni tekshiring:** Datchik kabelida xalaqit (noise) yoki kontakt kuchsizligi bor-yo'qligini ko'zdan kechiring."}
{"time": "2026-09-11T10:27:27.473193", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "gem", "question": "please go back and start again, because MW_ST5 is not at HP", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%M79.1` (`STA5StartHP`)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:** Bu signal 5-stansiya (ST5) avtomatik rejimda ishni boshlashi uchun barcha joylashuv mexanizmlari va silindrlar o'zining boshlang'ich (bosh/ishchi bo'lmagan) holatida (`Home Position` / 原位) ekanligini tasdiqlovchi PLC mantiqiy signalidir.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Mexanik holatni tekshiring:** 5-stansiyadagi barcha silindrlar, pnevmo-porshenlar va moslamalar jismonan oxirigacha ortga (boshlang'ich holatga) qaytganini va mexanik to'siqlar yo'qligini ko'zdan kechiring.\n2. **Sensorlarni tekshiring:** Boshlang'ich holatni aniqlovchi datchiklar (induktiv/gerkon sensorlar) ifloslanmaganini, kabeli uzilmaganini hamda ularning LED indikatorlari yonib turganini tekshiring.\n3. **Qo me'yoriga keltirish (Manual rejim):** Boshqaruv panelidan (HMI) 5-stansiyani qo'lda boshqarish (`Manual`) rejimiga o me'yoriga o'tkazing va mexanizmlarni majburiy boshlang'ich holatga (`HP Return`) qaytaring.\n4. **Xatolikni tashlash (Reset):** Pultdagi yoki ekrandagi **Reset** (`%I0.4` - FauitReset) tugmasini bosib xatolikni o'chiring va avtomatik tsiklni qayta boshlang."}
{"time": "2026-09-11T11:19:28.052434", "user_id": 5026106651, "username": "qurbonovjumanazar", "line": "gem", "question": "I13.4", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I13.4` (Tag nomi: `ICVBoreLinearSliWP`)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:** Kirish nazorat klapanining (Inlet Control Valve) teshik ochish/parmalash mexanizmi (slayderi) ishchi pozitsiyaga (oldinga/oxirigacha) to'liq surilganini tasdiqlovchi datchik (sensor) signali.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Mexanik holatni tekshiring:** Parmalash slayderi/silindri oxirigacha to'liq borayotganini va mexanik qisilish yoki to'siq yo'qligini vizual ko'zdan kechiring.\n2. **Datchikni (sensor) tekshiring:** Silindr ustidagi datchikning LED indikatori yonayotganini ko me'yorda ekanini ko'ring. Agar yonmasa, datchik yuzasini tozalang yoki o'rnini biroz sozlab ko'ring.\n3. **Pnevmatika va havo bosimi:** Silindrni harakatlantiruvchi havo bosimi yetarli ekanligini va pnevmo-klapan to'g'ri ishlayotganini tekshiring.\n4. **Kabel va PLC signalini tekshiring:** Datchik kabelida uzilish yoki shkastlanish yo'qligini, hamda PLC modulida `%I13.4` diodi yonayotganini tekshiring."}
{"time": "2026-09-11T11:24:14.787602", "user_id": 5026106651, "username": "qurbonovjumanazar", "line": "gem", "question": "I13.3", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I13.3` — `ICVBoreLinearSliHP` (进口控制阀打孔推动原位)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:** \nKirish nazorat klapanining teshik ochish/teshish slayderi (silindri) **boshlang'ich holatda (Home Position / 原位)** ekanligini bildiruvchi kirish signali. Ya'ni, teshish mexanizmi ortga to'liq qaytib, o'z joyida turganini PLC ga tasdiqlovchi sensor.\n\n⚠️ **Odatda yuzaga keladigan muammolar:**\n* Silindr mexanik ravishda tiqilib qolgan yoki havo bosimi yetarsizligi sababli oxirigacha ortga qaytmagan.\n* Boshlang'ich holat sensori (germkon yoki induktiv datchik) surilib ketgan, ifloslangan yoki buzilgan.\n* Sensor kabeli uzilgan, konnektor bo'shashgan yoki PLC kirish modulida aloqa yo'qolgan.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Mexanik holatni tekshiring:** Teshish slayderi/silindri rostdan ham oxirigacha ortga qaytganini va yo'lida hech qanday to'siq yo'qligini vizual ko'zdan kechiring.\n2. **Pnevmatika va havo bosimini tekshiring:** Tizimdagi havo bosimi normada ekanligini va pnevmoklapan to'g'ri ishlayotganini tekshiring.\n3. **Sensor indikatorini tekshiring:** Silindr boshlang'ich holatda turganda datchikdagi svetodiod (chiroq) yonayotganini ko mezing. \n   * *Agar yonmayotgan bo'lsa:* Datchik joylashuvini biroz surib sozlab ko'ring yoki sensor holatini tekshiring.\n4. **Elektr zanjirini tekshiring:** PLC shkafidagi `%I13.3` kirish indikatori yonayotganini va datchik kabeli uzilmaganini tester (multimetr) bilan tekshiring."}
{"time": "2026-09-11T11:31:42.625464", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "gem", "question": "bolt 1 not feeding", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I73.6` (`Bolt1WeldMainSliHP`)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:** 1-sonli issiqlik qalqoni kronshteyni (Bolt 1) payvandlash moslamasi asosiy slaydining boshlang'ich holati (Home Position) datchigi. Moslama surilmayotgan (not feeding) bo'lsa, PLC mexanizm boshlang'ich holatda ekanligini tasdiqlay olmayotgan bo'lishi yoki silindrga harakat komandasi berilmayotgan bo'lishi mumkin.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n1. **Datchik va signalni tekshiring:** `%I73.6` datchigida va PLC modulidagi LED indikatori yonayotganini tekshiring. Sensor joyidan surilib ketgan yoki ifloslangan bo'lishi mumkin.\n2. **Pnevmatika va klapanni tekshiring:** Slaydni harakatlantiruvchi pnevmo-tsilindrga havo bosimi yetib kelayotganini va mos solenoid klapan (valv) ishlayotganini ko'ring.\n3. **Mexanik holat:** Slayd yo'naltiruvchilarida (guide rails) tiqilib qolish, moylash yetishmasligi yoki payvandlash sachramalari to'smasligini tekshiring.\n4. **Kabel va ulanish:** Sensor kabeli uzilmagani hamda kontaktlar mahkamligini tekshiring."}
{"time": "2026-09-11T11:34:05.441358", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "watercool", "question": "Right station mold did not open", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** %Q30.4  \n\n📍 **Nima bu:**  Bu chiqish signali – “L15RightTankCanGet”.  O‘ng (Right) stansiyada mold ochilganda, bu signal **ON (1)** bo‘ladi va KUKA robotiga “oil tankni olish mumkin” degan ma’lumotni uzatadi. Agar signal OFF (0) bo‘lsa, mold hali ochilmagan yoki mexanik to‘siq bor deb hisoblanadi.  \n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**  \n1. **PLC‑ni tekshirish** – PLC ekranida %Q30.4 holatini ko‘ring. Agar OFF bo‘lsa, signal manbasiga (sensor, kontaktor) e’tibor qarating.  \n2. **Mold ochish sensorini (limit switch) tekshirish** – sensor kontakti va kabellarini vizual tekshiring: uzilish, qirilib ketish yoki oksidlanish bo‘lishi mumkin.  \n3. **Sensorni tozalash / almashtirish** – sensor yuzasini ifloslikdan tozalang, kontaktni mexanik jihatdan erkin harakatlanishini tekshiring; kerak bo‘lsa, sensor yoki switchni almashtiring.  \n4. **Mold mexanizmini tekshirish** – gidravlik yoki pnevmatik ochish tizimi (silindr, ventilya) normal ishlashini tekshiring; suv yoki yog‘ning bosimi yetarli‑mi, harakat to‘siqlari yo‘qligiga ishonch hosil qiling.  \n5. **Kabel ulanishini tekshirish** – %Q30.4 ga ulanadigan kabellarni, terminal blokini va rele kontaktlarini ko‘rib chiqing; loose (bo‘sh) yoki oksidlangan kontaktlar bo‘lsa, mahkam ulang yoki almashtiring.  \n6. **Rele yoki driver holatini tekshirish** – agar signal rele orqali berilsa, relening energiyalanishini (coil) va kontaktining yopilishini tasdiqlang; kerak bo‘lsa, rele/driverni reset qiling yoki almashtiring.  \n7. **Test qilish** – barcha ta’mirlar tugagandan so‘ng, PLC’da %Q30.4 ni “force ON” (qo‘lda ON qilish) qilib, robotga “tankni olish mumkin” signalini yuboring; mold ochilishini tasdiqlang.  \n\nAgar bu tekshiruvdan keyin ham muammo davom etsa, boshqa signal (masalan, %Q31.2 – “L15RightTankNG” – sovutish NG) ham tekshirilishi mumkin, lekin asosiy ehtimol – %Q30.4 ga bog‘liq sensor yoki mexanik to‘siq."}
{"time": "2026-09-11T11:39:28.838894", "user_id": 5026106651, "username": "qurbonovjumanazar", "line": "gem", "question": "I14.6", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** I14.6  \n\n📍 **Nima bu:** Bu - **VentBoreLinearSliHP** (VentBore Linear Slide “push to position”) deb nomlangan limit‑sensorning kirish signali. Sensor vent (chiqish) teshig‘i harakatlanuvchi slaydining belgilangan holatda, ya’ni to‘liq chiqish joyida yoki “push” holatida ekanligini PLC’ga bildiradi.  \n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**  \n\n1. **Indikatorni tekshiring** – HMI/Panelda bu signal “ON” (true) bo‘lsa, slayd to‘g‘ri joylashgan; “OFF” bo‘lsa, joylashmagan yoki sensor ishlamayapti.  \n2. **Kablolarni tekshiring** – I14.6 ga ulangan signal kablosini vizual ko‘rib chiqing, izolyatsiya shikastlanmaganligini, kontaktlar mahkam bo‘lishini tekshiring.  \n3. **Signal voltajini o‘lchang** – PLC kirish modulida 24 V DC (yoki tizimda belgilangan) bo‘lishi kerak. Voltaj yo‘q bo‘lsa – kabel uzilishi yoki kontakt ochilishi mumkin.  \n4. **Sensorni tozalang** – Sensorning kontakt yuzasida chang, yog‘ yoki metall qoldiqlari bo‘lsa, tozalang.  \n5. **Mexanik harakatni tekshiring** – Slaydni qo‘lda (yoki “jog” funksiyasi bilan) harakatlantiring, uning to‘liq “push” holatiga yetishini kuzating; har qanday mexanik to‘siq (yig‘ilish, blokirovka) signalni noto‘g‘ri ko‘rsatishi mumkin.  \n6. **Signalni simulyatsiya qiling** – PLC dasturida “force on” (signalni qo‘lda yoqish) funksiyasini ishga tushiring; agar PLC’da signal ON bo‘lsa, lekin sensor haqiqatan ishlamasa – sensor yoki uning ulanishida muammo bor.  \n7. **Rele/Modul holatini ko‘rib chiqing** – Kirish moduli “stuck” bo‘lishi mumkin; modulni qayta ishga tushiring yoki almashtiring.  \n\nAgar yuqoridagi tekshiruvdan so‘ng ham muammo hal bo‘lmasa, sensor o‘zi (kontakt yoki ichki mexanizmi) nosoz bo‘lishi ehtimoli bor – uni almashtirish tavsiya etiladi."}
{"time": "2026-09-11T11:39:37.514204", "user_id": 5026106651, "username": "qurbonovjumanazar", "line": "gem", "question": "I14.7", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** I14.7  \n\n📍 **Nima bu:** Bu – **VentBoreLinearSliWP** (vent‑bosh joyiga teshik qilish mexanizmini itarish holati) degan kirish (input) bayroqli signal. PLC bu signal orqali vent‑boshning itarish qurilmasi kerakli joyga yetganligini tekshiradi – ya'ni sensor “joyga borgan” holatda `TRUE` (1) bo‘ladi.\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**  \n1. **Vizual tekshiruv** – I14.7 ulanish joyidagi kontaktor, konnektor va sensorning holatini ko‘rib chiqing; ezilgan yoki zanglagan tel, bo‘shlangan kontakt yo‘qligini tasdiqlang.  \n2. **Sensorni tozalash** – sensor (odometrlik yoki proximitet) ifloslanmaganligini, mexanik blokirovkalar yo‘qligini tekshiring; kerak bo‘lsa tozalang.  \n3. **Kabelni o‘lchash** – megger yoki ohmmetr bilan I14.7 kabelining uzluksizligini, izolyatsiya qarshiligini tekshiring (odatda <1 kΩ).  \n4. **Signalni simulyatsiya qilish** – PLC dasturida “Force On/Force Off” (yoki test rejimi) orqali I14.7 ni qo‘lda `TRUE`/`FALSE` qilib ko‘ring; panelda yoki HMIda signalning o‘zgarishini ko‘rib, PLCga yetib bormayotganligini aniqlang.  \n5. **Mekanik tekshiruv** – vent‑bosh itarish mexanizmidagi harakatni qo‘lda bajaring; sensorning fizikal holati (yoyilganda yoki bosilganda) to‘g‘ri ishlashini kuzating.  \n6. **Dasturiy sozlamani ko‘rib chiqish** – PLC dasturida I14.7 ga tegishli alarm yoki logik bloklar to‘g‘ri konfigüratsiya qilinganligini tasdiqlang (masalan, debouncing, timeout).  \n7. **Qayta sinov** – barcha tekshiruvlardan so‘ng, mexanik harakatni bir necha marta takrorlang; sensor “joyga yetdi” holatda `TRUE` berayotganligini tasdiqlang.  \n\nAgar yuqoridagi qadamlar muammoni hal qilmasa, **kabel uzilishi**, **sensorning mexanik shikastlanishi yoki ifloslanishi**, **noto‘g‘ri ulanish (polarity/terminal mix‑up)** yoki **PLC modulining o‘zi (input kanali nosozligi)** kabi ehtimollarni yanada chuqurroq tekshirish kerak."}
{"time": "2026-09-11T14:11:29.807538", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "gem", "question": "Canister Weld:The fusion Pressure is too high", "answer": "🔧 **Likely Address:**\n- `%IW272` (CanisterWeldPress - Canister bracket welding pressure sensor)\n- `%M120.1` (CanisterWeldForceTempAlarm - Canister bracket welding force/temperature alarm tag)\n- `%T32` (CanisterWeldPressTimer - Canister bracket welding pressure alarm timer)\n\n📍 **What it is:**\n`%IW272` reads the analog signal from the pressure sensor on the canister bracket welding unit during the fusion process. If the detected pressure exceeds the safety/process upper limit, `%T32` times out and triggers alarm flag `%M120.1`.\n\n**Common causes:**\n- Pneumatic pressure regulator set too high.\n- Proportional valve or pressure control valve fault/sticking.\n- Mechanical obstruction or jamming during the fusion cylinder advance (`%Q53.2`).\n- Faulty pressure sensor or corrupted analog input wiring.\n- Pressure threshold settings modified incorrectly in HMI/PLC.\n\n✅ **What to do:**\n1. **Check Pneumatic Regulator:** Inspect the pressure regulator feeding the fusion cylinder (`CanisterWeldFusCyl`). Verify the gauge reading against machine specifications and lower the pressure if set too high.\n2. **Inspect Mechanical Hardware:** Ensure the fusion mechanism, heating plate, and slides move freely without mechanical binding or foreign object obstruction.\n3. **Verify Pressure Sensor (%IW272):** Compare the pressure shown on the machine's physical gauge with the HMI analog value. If the HMI shows high pressure while the physical gauge is normal, check sensor wiring or replace the pressure sensor.\n4. **Check Solenoid / Proportional Valves:** Verify that the fusion cylinder valves (`%Q53.2` / `%Q53.3`) operate smoothly and are not sticking open.\n5. **Reset Alarm:** Once pressure is normalized within specification limits, clear the alarm on the control panel."}
{"time": "2026-09-11T15:41:39.523042", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "gem", "question": "Vent no part", "answer": "🔧 **Likely Address:** \n* Primary: `%I92.3` (`VentWeldPartDetect` - Vent Weld Part Detect)\n* Secondary: `%I94.5` (`VentSerPartDetect` - Vent Feeding Part Detect)\n\n📍 **What it is:** \nThese signals detect the presence of the vent component. `%I92.3` checks whether the vent part is correctly loaded at the welding station, while `%I94.5` checks for the part at the feeding/feeder position. If the sensor does not turn ON when a part should be present, the system triggers a \"no part\" error.\n\n✅ **What to do:**\n1. **Physical Check:** Verify if a vent part is physically present at the welding fixture or feeding station.\n2. **Sensor Inspection:** Check the sensor head (photoelectric or proximity) for dust, oil, dirt, or mechanical misalignment. Clean and realign it if necessary.\n3. **Indicator Check:** Look at the LED indicator on the physical sensor when a part is in place to see if it turns on.\n4. **Wiring & Cable Check:** Inspect the sensor cable for damage, loose terminals, or broken wires leading back to the PLC module.\n5. **PLC Signal Test:** Place a part manually in front of the sensor and check if input `%I92.3` (or `%I94.5`) lights up in the PLC hardware status LEDs. Replace the sensor if it fails to trigger."}
{"time": "2026-09-11T15:43:42.774796", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "gem", "question": "Vent no part", "answer": "🔧 **Likely Address:**\n* **%I92.3** (VentWeldPartDetect - Vent Welding Part Presence Sensor) — *Most likely*\n* **%I94.5** (VentSerPartDetect - Vent Feeding Part Presence Sensor)\n\n📍 **What it is:**\nThese inputs represent photoelectric or proximity sensors that check whether the vent component (exhaust port part) is present in the machine. \n* `%I92.3` detects if the vent part is in place at the welding station.\n* `%I94.5` detects if the vent part is loaded into the feeding mechanism.\n\n✅ **What to do:**\n1. **Physical Inspection:** Verify if the vent part is physically present in the fixture or feeder and correctly seated/oriented.\n2. **Clean Sensor:** Inspect the sensor head/lens (`%I92.3` or `%I94.5`) for dirt, oil film, dust, or plastic residue, and clean it.\n3. **Sensor LED & Alignment:** Place a part in front of the sensor manually and check if the indicator light on the physical sensor turns on. Adjust the sensing distance/angle if necessary.\n4. **Wiring & Cable:** Check the sensor cable for damage, loose M12 connections, or broken wires.\n5. **PLC Input Status:** Verify on the PLC input module whether the LED for `%I92.3` or `%I94.5` lights up when the sensor is triggered."}
{"time": "2026-09-11T16:36:39.716604", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "gem", "question": "Gvv no part", "answer": "🔧 **Possible Address:** \n- `%I91.1` (`GVVWeldPartDetect` — GVV welding part detection)\n- `%I94.4` (`GVVSerPartDetect` — GVV feeding part detection)\n\n📍 **What it is:** \nDigital input signals from sensors that detect the physical presence of a part on the GVV (Flip Pressure Relief Valve) station. `%I91.1` checks if the part is loaded in the welding position, while `%I94.4` checks if a part is present in the feeding mechanism.\n\n✅ **What to do:** \n1. **Check part presence & alignment:** Verify if the part is physically present and properly seated in the fixture or feeding track.\n2. **Inspect the sensor:** Clean dust, plastic chips, or oil buildup off the sensor lens/face.\n3. **Verify sensor status LED:** Check if the LED indicator on the physical sensor lights up when a part is manually placed in front of it.\n4. **Check distance & mechanical adjustment:** Ensure the sensor is not shifted or mounted too far from the part detection point.\n5. **Inspect cabling & PLC Input:** Check the wiring for loose connections or damage. Verify if input `%I91.1` or `%I94.4` lights up on the PLC rack when triggered. Replace the sensor if it remains OFF despite receiving a part."}
{"time": "2026-09-21T12:23:28.603694", "user_id": 1047268578, "username": "Barotjon_Adizov", "line": "gem", "question": "I20.3", "answer": "🔧 **Ehtimoliy manzil:** `%I20.3` (Tag nomi: `FIXUpWP3` / `初始放置位油箱定位检测3`)\n\n📍 **Nima bu:**\nUshbu signal — dastlabki joylashtirish o'rnida (Initial placement position) 3-sonli yonilg'i baki (detal) to'g'ri o'rnatilganligini aniqlovchi datchikning (sensor) raqamli kirish signalidir (Digital Input).\n\n**Uskuna mantiqidagi o'rni:** \nUshbu datchik detal moslamaga (fiksatorga) aniq va to'g'ri joylashganini tasdiqlaydi. PLC mantiqiga ko'ra, agar ushbu signal (`%I20.3 = 1`) kelmasa:\n* Avtomatik payvandlash yoki siklni boshlashga ruxsat berilmaydi.\n* Pnevmatik/gidravlik siquvchi moslamalar (klamplar) yopilmaydi.\n* Robot detalni ushlab olish (pick-up) siklini boshlamaydi.\n\n---\n\n✅ **Nima qilish kerak:**\n\n### 1. Mexanik va vizual tekshiruv (Birinchi galda)\n* **Detal joylashuvi:** Yonilg'i baki 3-pozitsiyaga to'g'ri, qirmasdan va o'tiroq holatda joylashganini tekshiring.\n* **To'siqlar:** Datchik va detal o'rtasida chok sachramalari (spatter), chang, yog' yoki mexanik to'siq yo'qligiga ishonch hosil qiling.\n* **Datchik masofasi:** Datchik ajratilib ketmaganmi yoki surilib ketmaganmi? Detalgacha bo'lgan masofani tekshiring (induktiv datchiklar uchun odatda 2–4 mm).\n\n### 2. Datchikning o'zini tekshirish\n* Detal joyida turganda datchik korpusidagi **LED indikatori** (chirog'i) yonayotganini ko'ring.\n* **Manual test:** Detalni olib tashlab, datchik yuzasiga metal buyum (masalan, otvyortka yoki kalit) yaqinlashtiring.\n  * *Agar LED yonmassa:* Datchikka 24V quvvat kelmayapti yoki datchik nosoz.\n  * *Agar LED yonsa:* Datchik ishlayapti, demak masofa noto'g'ri sozlangan yoki kabel uzatishda muammo bor.\n\n### 3. Elektr zanjirini multimetr bilan tekshirish\n* **Quvvatni tekshirish:** Datchik terminal qutisida (Junction Box) brown (+24V) va blue (0V) simlar o'rtasida **24V DC** kuchlanish borligini multimetrda o'lchang.\n* **Signalni tekshirish:** Datchik faol holatida (signal berganda) black (Signal simi) va 0V o'rtasida **24V DC** chiqayotganini tekshiring.\n  * *Agar kuchlanish 0V bo'lsa:* Datchik almashtirilishi kerak.\n\n### 4. Kabel va PLC modulini tekshirish\n* **Kabel liniyasi:** Datchikdan PLC moduligacha bo mehanik harakatlanuvchi kabel kanallarida (cable track) kabel ezilmagani yoki uzilmaganini tekshiring.\n* **PLC indikatori:** PLC kirish modulida **I20.3** (20-bayt, 3-bit) chirog'i yonayotganini tekshiring.\n  * *Agar datchikda LED yonib, PLC modulida I20.3 yonmasa:* Datchik va PLC o'rtasidagi signal simida uzilish bor yoki klemma bo'shab qolgan."}
